Provenance of the Master System and Game Gear machine layer (runtime/guests/sms)

Device behavior is ported from ares, https://github.com/ares-emulator/ares,
commit 0b928930af4cc59ed99e942996f0d3c815379388, ISC license (text below).
The code here is new C11 in relift's catch-up shape; each ported file keeps
the ISC notice in its header.

psg.c     the SN76489 (tone and noise channels, the 16-bit shift register,
          the latch), the console's mix and the Game Gear stereo port
                                   component/audio/sn76489/sn76489.cpp,
                                   ms/psg/psg.cpp
vdp.c     the VDP: ports, registers, VRAM and CRAM, the counters, the line
          and frame interrupts, mode 4 and the TMS9918 graphics modes 1 and
          2, sprites, the colour output
                                   ms/vdp/vdp.cpp, io.cpp, irq.cpp,
                                   background.cpp, sprite.cpp, dac.cpp

